{
    "title": "BeTidy: Home Cleaning Schedule",
    "description": "Discover the smart method for a tidy home! \r\nClean out. Organize. Tidy up. Clean. With BeTidy you can now organize your household chores with ease!\r\n\r\nSAVE TIME WITH YOUR DIGITAL CLEANING SCHEDULE\r\nOrganize your home and save your household time.\r\n\r\nREDUCE MENTAL LOAD\r\nPlan all your chores and home organization tasks so you don't have to think about them anymore.\r\n\r\nFEEL GOOD AGAIN\r\nTogether we will create a neat and tidy home for you to finally feel comfy in.\r\n\r\nSHARE TASKS FAIRLY\r\nAssign tasks to each family member fairly so that everyone gets to contribute.\r\n\r\nWhat BeTidy can do for you:\r\n\r\nCLEANING\r\nPlan your cleaning & household tasks and BeTidy will automatically create an annual cleaning schedule for you. Intervals help you easily manage recurring chores tasks.\r\n\r\nORGANIZING\r\nWith the help of home organization projects, we guide you step-by-step to the perfect result. Want to organize your wardrobe? No problem, start now and create an organization project. Add before and after images to your projects and let the results motivate you next time around.\r\n\r\nDAILY CLEANING SCHEDULE\r\nYour daily plan will be created based on your planned cleaning and home organization tasks. You can also view overdue or future tasks at any time. Simply check your completed tasks. And if you want, we can send you daily notifications to remind you of upcoming tasks.\r\n\r\nSHARED FAMILY PROFILES\r\nCreate custom profiles for your family members. Tasks can be assigned to one or more people. This way you can distribute tasks fairly, because household chores and home organization affects all family members.\r\n\r\nFIND YOUR MOTIVATION\r\nThe ranking shows you who has completed the most tasks. Depending on the effort, tasks award points that are collected once they are checked off. You can challenge your partner or introduce younger family members to tidy housekeeping in a playful way. This increases motivation and at the same time everyone pulls together.\r\n\r\n\r\nBeTidy Pro can be activated via in-app purchase with a monthly ($3.99 per month), half-yearly ($20.95 per six-month) or yearly ($35.90 per year) subscription.\r\n\r\nSubscriptions are charged to your credit card through your Google account. Your subscription will automatically renew unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage your subscription in your account settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nBeTidy data privacy protection: https://betidy.io/en/data-privacy-app/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the smart method for a tidy home! <br>Clean out. Organize. Tidy up. Clean. With BeTidy you can now organize your household chores with ease!<br><br>SAVE TIME WITH YOUR DIGITAL CLEANING SCHEDULE<br>Organize your home and save your household time.<br><br>REDUCE MENTAL LOAD<br>Plan all your chores and home organization tasks so you don&#39;t have to think about them anymore.<br><br>FEEL GOOD AGAIN<br>Together we will create a neat and tidy home for you to finally feel comfy in.<br><br>SHARE TASKS FAIRLY<br>Assign tasks to each family member fairly so that everyone gets to contribute.<br><br>What BeTidy can do for you:<br><br>CLEANING<br>Plan your cleaning &amp; household tasks and BeTidy will automatically create an annual cleaning schedule for you. Intervals help you easily manage recurring chores tasks.<br><br>ORGANIZING<br>With the help of home organization projects, we guide you step-by-step to the perfect result. Want to organize your wardrobe? No problem, start now and create an organization project. Add before and after images to your projects and let the results motivate you next time around.<br><br>DAILY CLEANING SCHEDULE<br>Your daily plan will be created based on your planned cleaning and home organization tasks. You can also view overdue or future tasks at any time. Simply check your completed tasks. And if you want, we can send you daily notifications to remind you of upcoming tasks.<br><br>SHARED FAMILY PROFILES<br>Create custom profiles for your family members. Tasks can be assigned to one or more people. This way you can distribute tasks fairly, because household chores and home organization affects all family members.<br><br>FIND YOUR MOTIVATION<br>The ranking shows you who has completed the most tasks. Depending on the effort, tasks award points that are collected once they are checked off. You can challenge your partner or introduce younger family members to tidy housekeeping in a playful way. This increases motivation and at the same time everyone pulls together.<br><br><br>BeTidy Pro can be activated via in-app purchase with a monthly ($3.99 per month), half-yearly ($20.95 per six-month) or yearly ($35.90 per year) subscription.<br><br>Subscriptions are charged to your credit card through your Google account. Your subscription will automatically renew unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage your subscription in your account settings after purchase.<br><br>BeTidy data privacy protection: https://betidy.io/en/data-privacy-app/",
